  "notes": "family: point-salad-euro. Verified against official v1.2 rulebook PDF: end after round 5; Capitalist -5 VP per Loan; others pay 55 per Loan, -1 VP per 5 unpaid. Working: policy table 1/4/8/12/18, 1 VP per 10 money (max 15). Middle: 1/3/6/10/15, 1 VP per 15 money, storages food/2 and luxury/health/education per 3 (excl. Goods & Services). Capitalist: 1/4/8/12/18, storages incl. Free Trade Zone, no money VP. State: storages incl. media, 1 VP per 30 Treasury. Role-dependent scoring uses cat_role; enter each role once. Inapplicable counts must be zero. State tiebreak policies = matches with its Political Agenda card (normally discarded in the Scoring Phase, so count must be taken before discarding in final round).",
